# Local-only / private overlays — content lives in separate private repos.
# Workflow: edit in the private repo, deploy here, never commit from here.
# Any folder/file under these patterns is treated as transient runtime state.
**/_local/
**/_private/
specialized/_*.md
.claude/agents/_*.md

# Run / scratch artifacts (extraction scripts, intermediate files, etc.)
output/

# Personal documents and coursework
docs/
hw_sim.py
upload_workflow.py

